{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:c820fe99b796beee","name":"Praetorian-Class Frigate","source":{"id":"source:reference-c820fe99b796beee","title":"Praetorian-Class Frigate","revision":19288,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:40:09Z","sha256":"d066923de894baead89a809f407b8d1a41bd252141ff76de7f079e1bf4c88f1d","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19288","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Praetorian-Class%20Frigate&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-c820fe99b796beee","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Old Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Old_Republic","referenceId":"reference:6517b7e15507b001"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Originally commissioned as a vessel of war during ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Great Sith War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Great_Sith_War"},", the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Praetorian"]},"-Class Frigate is a modestly sized Capital Ship found in the hands of wealthy organizations and planetary governments across the galaxy. The predecessor to the larger ",{"tag":"a","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Hammerhead"]},"-Class Cruisers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hammerhead-Class_Cruisers"}," used by the Republic Navy, the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Praetorian"]},"-Class Frigate is a tough and powerful vessel for its size. Despite objections of Naval officials who claimed that such firepower should not be placed in civilian control, Rendili Hyperworks obtains permission from the Republic Senate to sell its remaining stock of ",{"tag":"i","children":["Praetorian"]},"-Class Frigates on a limited basis.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The 180-meter-long ",{"tag":"i","children":["Praetorian"]},"-Class Frigate serves ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Old Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Old_Republic","referenceId":"reference:6517b7e15507b001"}," well at the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Koros Major"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Koros_Major?action=edit&redlink=1"}," during ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Great Sith War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Great_Sith_War"},", and afterward those vessels sold to the public are mostly used in peacekeeping roles. During the Republic's rebuilding years, these vessels are used to protect newly discovered hyperspace trade routes and to escort supply ships and relief caravans across the galaxy. With large quantities of resources being moved from one region of the galaxy to another on a daily basis, pirates and other unsavory predators make frequent attacks on transport ships carrying relief supplies, necessitating the presence of a ",{"tag":"i","children":["Praetorian"]},"-Class Frigate to deter piracy.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Eventually, Rendili Hyperworks will sell the design to the Corellian Engineering Corporation. Under the guidance of CEC engineers, the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Praetorian"]},"-Class Frigate is remodeled and updated over the years, being rebranded as the Class VI Bulk Freighter and converted almost entirely to a cargo transport role.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Praetorian"]},"-Class Frigate Statistics (CL 14)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Colossal (Frigate) ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ship"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," -4; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.mirahez